{"availability":"available","full":"Rohittt29/MeetMind","name":"MeetMind","description":"MeetMind is an enterprise-grade AI Productivity Agent that listens to the outcome of your meetings and actually does the legwork. Instead of sending one massive prompt, it uses an Agentic Chain . generative-ai  llm  python  gemini-api  agentic-ai  rag  streamlit  nlp","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-25T19:39:54Z","updated":"2026-04-06T08:13:33Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://meet-mind.streamlit.app/","topics":["agentic-ai","gemini-api","generative-ai","llm","nlp","python","rag","streamlit"],"demo":"https://meet-mind.streamlit.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:45.088Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:45.088Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:45.088Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T09:07:45.088Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn Any Meeting Into Action — Automatically.","MeetMind is an enterprise-grade AI Productivity Agent built to eliminate the loss of critical information that happens post-meeting. Instead of relying on bloated, generalized summary prompt walls, MeetMind is powered by an advanced Multi-Agent Chain using Google's fastest gemini-2.5-flash endpoint. It processes your internal meeting transcripts and outputs highly structured, immediately actionable data.","Unproductive meetings cost businesses billions every year. The absolute biggest leak is follow-through. Valuable insights dissolve into thin air because action items aren't explicitly tracked and dedicated follow-up emails are notoriously postponed. MeetMind solves this instantly."],"features":["🔄 3-Step Agentic Pipeline: Different specialized prompts are fed down a seamless queue ensuring perfect structured JSON constraint extractions.","Context Agent: Condenses heavy jargon into 3-sentence summaries and flags unresolved conflicts.","Task Agent: Maps precise action items, assigning explicit owners, strict deadlines, and visual priority badges.","Communication Agent: Auto-drafts personalized, pre-written follow-up communications per stakeholder.","🎯 Meeting Health Score algorithm: Get graded (X/10) dynamically on Clarity, Decisiveness, and Accountability."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Rohittt29/MeetMind/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a66a06c6cf25406da268a2a7237fe0cfe8f0e9616a3174d752462554351cac8c","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:45.273Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:45.273Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Turn Any Meeting Into Action — Automatically.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Rohittt29/MeetMind/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a66a06c6cf25406da268a2a7237fe0cfe8f0e9616a3174d752462554351cac8c","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Rohittt29/MeetMind/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:45.274Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-04-06T08:13:33Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Rohittt29/MeetMind/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T09:07:45.274Z","hash":"a66a06c6cf25406da268a2a7237fe0cfe8f0e9616a3174d752462554351cac8c","originalBytes":9341,"storedBytes":9341,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["agent","context","json","action","emails","items","meeting","return","transcript","key","meetmind","python","text","follow-up","tasks","dict","output","personalized","step","summary","await","each","end","extract","max","participants","start","what","async","communication","content","create","def","gemini-2.5-flash","pipeline","receives","response","system","task","bash","code","does","model","only","outputs","owners","retry","role","structured","timeout","venv","why","api","attempt","call","client","client.messages.create","conflicts","creates","deadlines","decisions","design","environment","gemini","genai.anthropic","google","implementation","import","json.","json.loads","